{"code":"N7","wikidata":"Q873690","wikipedia":{"en":"Saphan Khwai BTS station","th":"สถานีสะพานควาย"},"summary":{"en":"Saphan Khwai station is a BTS skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Phaya Thai District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is located on Phahonyothin Road near Saphan Khwai intersection, in a dense trade area with many shops, fresh markets and apartments, at the front of Saphan Khwai market and Paolo Memorial Hospital. Big C Supercenter (Saphan Khwai branch) and Thai Philatelic Museum (stamp museum) at Sam Sen Nai post office are located to the south of the station.","th":"สถานีสะพานควาย เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพหลโยธินบริเวณหน้าที่ทำการไปรษณีย์สามเสนใน ในพื้นที่เขตพญาไท กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Bangkok_skytrain_Saphan_Khwal.JPG/960px-Bangkok_skytrain_Saphan_Khwal.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_skytrain_Saphan_Khwal.JPG","author":"Colocho","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Saphan_Khwai_BTS_Station.jpg/960px-Saphan_Khwai_BTS_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saphan_Khwai_BTS_Station.jpg","author":"Thanapas.som","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Saphan_Khwai_Station_20230903-1.jpg/960px-Saphan_Khwai_Station_20230903-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saphan_Khwai_Station_20230903-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Saphan_Khwai_Station_20230903-2.jpg/960px-Saphan_Khwai_Station_20230903-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikime